---
description: Project rules – read AGENTS.md before changing code
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md): workflow, definition of done, layout, module pattern, naming, API/auth/security rules, testing, and git conventions.

- New CRUD resource: `pnpm gen:module <name> --fields "..."`, then customize.
- Provider details (auth, ORM, storage, Redis): [docs/providers.md](../../docs/providers.md).
- Keep `// @gen:` markers.
- Verify every change: `pnpm check:fix && pnpm type-check && pnpm test`.
